%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Three short stories, each tying a Function to the value it serves, in a stakeholder's own words. Why the guide waits, then tells both (OS-01). Why painful questions go to a person (OS-02). Why the guide asks first (OS-03). Voices are provisional: written by the group, not yet heard from stakeholders.

= Objective Story - Tell us both [OS-01] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-01
|Name|Tell us both
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-03, HFC-06.
|Narrative|//Elena:// "At the counter I talked all day. Now a word goes, and the story goes with it. Give me a moment. If it doesn't come back, remind us both where I was, not just me."
|Concerns|F2 Keep the thread; HV-02 Dignity, HV-06 Social connectedness

= Objective Story - Fetch me [OS-02] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-02
|Name|Fetch me
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; HFC-08; IDP-03.
|Narrative|//Myra:// "When Elena asks for Thomas, I want the guide to fetch me, not to answer her. Her son and I agreed what to say. One colleague told her bluntly, another said 'He's at work'; she trusted neither of us after that."
|Concerns|F4 Defer sensitive topics; HV-08 Truthfulness, HV-05 Well-being

= Objective Story - Not a dog [OS-03] =

**Report Format:** §2.2 Personas and Profiles

== Fields ==

|=Field|=Description
|ID|OS-03
|Name|Not a dog
|Status|In Progress
|Evidence basis|Provisional. Group reasoning; VT-07.
|Narrative|//Jan:// "I'm not a dog to be walked. I go out to see Elena, or the roses. The thing asks, and if I say no, that's that."
|Concerns|F1 Ask first; HV-01 Autonomy, HV-02 Dignity

== Graph edges ==

OS-01: narrates → F2, HV-02, HV-06; serves → OBJ-01, OBJ-07.

OS-02: narrates → F4, HV-08, HV-05; serves → OBJ-04.

OS-03: narrates → F1, HV-01, HV-02; serves → OBJ-06.
